OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fcontinue to thicken through the
OL,7,Fevening, with light rain developing
OL,8,Fand slowly clearing eastwards
OL,9,Fovernight. Dry and often clear
OL,10,Fconditions will follow but it will
OL,11,Fturn chilly, with mist and fog patches
OL,12,Fforming in places by dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FAny early mist and fog
OL,15,Fpatches will soon clear to leave a
OL,16,Ffine and dry day with light winds and
OL,17,Fplenty of sunshine, though hazy at
OL,18,Ftimes. Feeling pleasantly warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
